   "fix": "LOCAL_SPLIT=1: local_rr from its own kept return register at the S face (far_rr keeps return_d at the W face); calendar head from the local valid/select pin registers so each local request pin has one capture flop; 0 added edges, lockstep bit-identical; LGTAP2 10-18: ot_hbm_vm_lg_keep_reg unparameterised so SYNTH_KEEP_MODULES matches it (r2 gate CTS probe: the \\$paramod copy was flattened and folded into return_d, local_rr 329.7 ps from the W face)"
